{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quiver and Die is a medieval top down zombie shooter where you play as an archer in a zombie infested dark fantasy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With beautiful, <i>hand drawn</i> art and <i>carefully hand crafted</i> levels, Quiver and Die aims to provide a <strong>fun</strong>, <strong>action-packed</strong> and <strong>visually stunning</strong> gameplay experience. Here\u2019s what you can expect from the game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Infinite Replay Value</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655330/extras/ArrowsExplosive-12fps.gif?t=1744638255\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight never ending waves of zombies in four unique, hand crafted locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build Your Arsenal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655330/extras/_Arrow_Types_in_Line.gif?t=1744638255\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect more arrows to help you fight and unlock powerful upgrades to become a zombie-killing machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Rescue Your Friend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655330/extras/FrogShivering-12fps.gif?t=1744638255\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight your way to the Castle, where your kidnapped friend is being held, and free him from the zombie\u2019s putrid clutches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>And much...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655330/extras/UpgradesLegendary-12fps.gif?t=1744638255\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<strong>...MUCH...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655330/extras/Secrets-Short-12fps.gif?t=1744638255\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <strong>...MORE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655330/extras/FocusArrowFinisher-12fps.gif?t=1744638255\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3655330?t=1744638255","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655330/82fa2b4a0129af412bde089a8dc74b0c7a6ac935/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744638255","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655330/3163d3e17d73c544389221ef9865f7b8226e96ba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744638255","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655330/3163d3e17d73c544389221ef9865f7b8226e96ba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744638255","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quiver and Die is a medieval top down zombie shooter where you play as an archer in a zombie infested dark fantasy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With beautiful, <i>hand drawn</i> art and <i>carefully hand crafted</i> levels, Quiver and Die aims to provide a <strong>fun</strong>, <strong>action-packed</strong> and <strong>visually stunning</strong> gameplay experience. Here\u2019s what you can expect from the game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Infinite Replay Value</strong></h2><p clas